{
 "$note": [
  "ADR-125: curated ingredient-name -> USDA FoodData Central target map.",
  "This file contains NO nutrition values. scripts/build-fdc-aliases.ts resolves every",
  "target live against the FDC API (foods/search -> GET /food/{fdcId}?format=full),",
  "refuses any target whose returned description does not contain `expect` (each |-",
  "separated fragment must appear), refuses duplicate keys, and extracts per-100g",
  "nutrients plus unit weights ONLY from USDA's own foodPortions records. A food USDA",
  "gives no portion for keeps no unit weights: its volume lines stay `unweighed`,",
  "exactly as designed.",
  "`keys` are the food strings parseIngredientLine actually produced in the 2026-11-24",
  "production gap profile plus high-frequency equivalents from the Gate A corpus.",
  "Ambiguous bare names ('rice' alone) are aliased only where raw/cooked is derivable",
  "from the record choice and said in source_note. Foods FDC genuinely lacks (garam",
  "masala, kasuri methi, curry leaves, black salt, hing, idli/dosa batter) are absent",
  "on purpose. Dietitian pass pending: every row ships reviewed=false."
 ],
